[
{
"start": 15.54,
"end": 21.06,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Linear is the issue tracker built for speed \u2013 designed for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 14,
"char_end": 86,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 21.12,
"end": 22.92,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 87,
"char_end": 108,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 22.92,
"end": 31.44,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Before we get started, Stefan Brandt was on the show and mentioned that drainage is the design decision with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 109,
"char_end": 237,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 31.44,
"end": 32.04,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 252,
"char_end": 265,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 32.1,
"end": 35.1,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And that connects to what we are discussing today.",
"char_start": 266,
"char_end": 316,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 35.1,
"end": 40.56,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I'd like to point something out \u2013 Stefan Brandt mentioned a similar dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 331,
"char_end": 426,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.86,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Can you give me a specific example?",
"char_start": 427,
"char_end": 462,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 211.92,
"end": 215.1,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 463,
"char_end": 512,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 215.1,
"end": 222.06,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 527,
"char_end": 623,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 222.12,
"end": 225.3,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 624,
"char_end": 669,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 225.36,
"end": 229.08,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 670,
"char_end": 722,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 229.08,
"end": 230.52,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 737,
"char_end": 770,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 230.58,
"end": 233.76,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 771,
"char_end": 820,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 233.76,
"end": 234.06,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 835,
"char_end": 845,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 234.12,
"end": 239.64,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a small adjustment to the suspension.",
"char_start": 846,
"char_end": 950,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 239.7,
"end": 243.84,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The context is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 951,
"char_end": 1029,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 243.84,
"end": 244.86,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1044,
"char_end": 1062,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 244.92,
"end": 248.1,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 1063,
"char_end": 1112,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 248.1,
"end": 255.84,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes you can survive.",
"char_start": 1127,
"char_end": 1247,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.9,
"end": 259.02,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1248,
"char_end": 1292,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 259.08,
"end": 263.4,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll have to rebuild it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1293,
"char_end": 1365,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 263.4,
"end": 264.9,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where does it break down?",
"char_start": 1380,
"char_end": 1405,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 264.9,
"end": 269.28,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly visible.",
"char_start": 1420,
"char_end": 1496,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 269.34,
"end": 273.6,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that most people overlook.",
"char_start": 1497,
"char_end": 1563,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 273.6,
"end": 276.72,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the heuristic (or guiding principle) that you always come back to?",
"char_start": 1578,
"char_end": 1652,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 276.78,
"end": 279.18,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1653,
"char_end": 1699,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 279.18,
"end": 280.14,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1714,
"char_end": 1734,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 280.2,
"end": 285.84,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Erosion patterns on the track sections change the line choices between training and race day.",
"char_start": 1735,
"char_end": 1828,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 840.0,
"end": 841.44,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1843,
"char_end": 1876,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 841.5,
"end": 844.5,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
"char_start": 1877,
"char_end": 1933,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 844.5,
"end": 847.68,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 1948,
"char_end": 1999,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 847.74,
"end": 853.74,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 2000,
"char_end": 2082,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 853.8,
"end": 856.98,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2083,
"char_end": 2128,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 857.04,
"end": 861.3,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that most people overlook.",
"char_start": 2129,
"char_end": 2195,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 861.3,
"end": 863.04,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What does the error scenario look like?",
"char_start": 2210,
"char_end": 2249,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 863.1,
"end": 867.9,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most listeners do not have access to?",
"char_start": 2250,
"char_end": 2328,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 867.9,
"end": 874.08,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a small adjustment to the suspension.",
"char_start": 2343,
"char_end": 2457,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 874.14,
"end": 878.28,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The context is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 2458,
"char_end": 2536,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 878.28,
"end": 880.14,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Give me a specific example.",
"char_start": 2551,
"char_end": 2578,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 880.2,
"end": 883.2,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
"char_start": 2579,
"char_end": 2635,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 883.2,
"end": 890.64,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 2650,
"char_end": 2765,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 890.7,
"end": 893.88,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2766,
"char_end": 2811,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 893.94,
"end": 897.66,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2812,
"char_end": 2864,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 897.66,
"end": 899.16,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Tell me more about it.",
"char_start": 2879,
"char_end": 2901,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 899.16,
"end": 903.54,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this becomes clearly visible.",
"char_start": 2916,
"char_end": 2997,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 903.6,
"end": 908.52,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Once you understand this principle, the remaining decisions will become easier.",
"char_start": 2998,
"char_end": 3077,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s02"
},
{
"start": 908.52,
"end": 909.54,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 3092,
"char_end": 3110,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 909.6,
"end": 913.2,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of enduro racing?",
"char_start": 3111,
"char_end": 3167,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 913.2,
"end": 920.28,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Ultimately, the erosion patterns on the track sections influence the choice of racing line between training and race day.",
"char_start": 3182,
"char_end": 3303,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 920.34,
"end": 924.06,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I have observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3304,
"char_end": 3358,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 1320.0,
"end": 1325.04,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Let's change the subject \u2013 I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 3373,
"char_end": 3456,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 1325.04,
"end": 1332.42,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises regarding risk management permeate everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 3471,
"char_end": 3608,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 1332.42,
"end": 1334.16,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
